docs {
  # MTSS Sample Data > Assign a Student to an Intervention
  
  Vendor actions behind the "Assign a Student to an Intervention" certification steps (`bruno/MTSS/v5/intervention`).
  Run the Foundation first. Run each script, then the certification step it feeds.
  
  | Script | Feeds certification step |
  | --- | --- |
  | Step 1 | 01 - 1st StudentInterventionAssociation is valid |
  | Step 2 | 02 - 2nd StudentInterventionAssociation is valid |
  | Step 3 | 03 - 1st StudentInterventionAssociation - dosage was Updated |
  | Step 4 | 04 - 2nd StudentInterventionAssociation was Deleted |
}
